  "historyNote": "#6745, eff 5-1-98, EXPIRED: 12-31-98; ss by #6925, eff 1-1-99; ss by #8780, INTERIM, eff 1-1-07, EXPIRES: 6-30-07; ss by #8929, eff 6-30-07; amd by #9103, eff 3-12-08; amd by #9366, eff 1-17-09; amd by #9622, eff 1-1-10; amd by #9836, eff 12-18-10; ss by #10504, eff 1-9-14; amd by #10561, eff 3-29-14",
